            "review_title": "Review at San Fu Lou Mplaza - Cantonese Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Lisado976\nSan Jose, California234 contributions\n0\nGood food and good valued\nJan 2026 • Couples\nWe came during lunch hours on a Sunday, so it was not busy at all. We had the buffet and loved it. The food items included in the buffet are adequate and the food quality is very good. We specifically loved the duck noodle soup, the stir-fried green beans, the salted egg steam buns, and the coconut milk jello. The service staff is friendly and attentive. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 18, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
